| **File** | pom.xml |\n| **Issue** | The MySQL connector required an update for better Java 17 support |\n| **Fix** | Updated from version 8.0.33 to 8.2.0 |\n| **Impact** | Improved Java 17 compatibility and performance |\n\n### 2. Maven Compiler Plugin Update\n\n| Detail | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| **Severity** | High |\n| **File** | pom.xml |\n| **Issue** | Outdated Maven compiler plugin version |\n| **Fix** | Updated from version 3.7.0 to 3.11.0 |\n| **Impact** | Enhanced build compatibility with Java 17 |\n\n### 3. Spring Boot Version Upgrade\n\n| Detail | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| **Severity** | High |\n| **File** | pom.xml |\n| **Issue** | Spring Boot 2.7.15 is not fully optimized for Java 17 |\n| **Fix** | Upgraded to Spring Boot 3.2.0 |\n| **Impact** | Full Java 17 compatibility and Jakarta EE support |\n| **Breaking Change** | Yes - requires migration from javax.* to jakarta.* |\n\n### 4. Maven Compiler Source/Target Settings\n\n| Detail | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| **Severity** | Medium |\n| **File** | pom.xml |\n| **Issue** | Maven compiler source and target set to Java 11 |\n| **Fix** | Updated to Java 17 |\n| **Impact** | Ensures code is compiled with Java 17 language features |\n\n### 5. Legacy JDBC Driver Loading Pattern\n\n| Detail | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| **Severity** | Medium |\n| **File** | src/main/java/com/test/DatabaseService.java |\n| **Issue** | Outdated JDBC driver loading pattern using Class.forName() |\n| **Fix** | Removed unnecessary Class.forName() call; drivers are automatically loaded in Java 6+ |\n| **Impact** | Cleaner code, removed unnecessary exception handling |\n\n## Code Changes\n\n### DatabaseService.java\n\n**Before:**\n```java\npublic Connection getConnection() throws SQLException {\n    Connection conn = null;\n    try {\n        // Legacy JDBC driver loading pattern that needs to be updated for Java 17\n        Class.forName(\"com.mysql.cj.jdbc.Driver\")